Notebook[{
Cell["QuantumInterferometer: symbolic behaviour", "Title",
 CellID->874461601,ExpressionUUID->"22a1a762-10e3-861e-525e-3f4ca097ed64"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Every output below was produced by the installed kernel (WL 15.0) on \
QuantumFramework ",
 Cell[BoxData["main"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4da796ef-9f57-a4bf-7b5c-0fc91ae30e85"],
 " at a28fd507 (2026-10-27), plus the fixes to ",
 Cell["Interferometer.m", "InlineCode",ExpressionUUID->
  "1b39f900-6440-cee7-4ac6-f16a0dfa94cd"],
 " committed with this page (lossy probabilities without ",
 Cell[BoxData["Conjugate"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "75d93363-5da6-51a4-23e6-ab4d5453238e"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData["Assumptions"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "25a568a6-87a2-527f-535a-810032572145"],
 " in ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Probabilities\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "00d7f70d-8d0e-ae34-30ec-ef5724b8f51e"],
 " and rejection of contradictory ones from ",
 Cell[BoxData["Assuming"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2f3e8453-9762-68ea-56c5-1e1d22173a30"],
 ", coherent slots in the all-outputs form). That kernel includes the \
physical-domain contract (c1901374), the compact squeezed, coherent and \
mixed-state results (23ac0cf1), lossy and coherent sampling (c91ca9ad, \
24f5679f) and the photon-number allowlist (46f9ebf6). Association keys print \
as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"QuditName", "[", 
   RowBox[{"{", "...", "}"}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5902d484-617f-9570-0f31-cdee100bfc5a"],
 "; the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\"\<Dual\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "False"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "56e0e12c-de7d-6135-7e9f-f889db08301f"],
 " option is omitted here. The usage message of ",
 Cell[BoxData["QuantumInterferometer"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5708d032-2150-04f2-7d37-ca7c50e56ed8"],
 " now lists only the call forms, so this page is the reference for symbolic \
behaviour."
}], "Text",
 CellID->36768919,ExpressionUUID->"3b7807e8-9504-b25a-6907-9eb21cb600a0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Physical domain.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Photon numbers are nonnegative integers, beam-splitter angles \[Theta], \
\[CurlyPhi] and phase angles \[Alpha] are real, loss transmissivities \[Eta] \
are real with 0 \[LessEqual] \[Eta] \[LessEqual] 1, coherent amplitudes and \
squeezing parameters are complex. Symbolic results hold on this domain and \
carry no condition that restates it."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1699946459,ExpressionUUID->"166f8969-5e31-e8e5-3e14-21335bc5bacf"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"bs", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"QuantumInterferometer", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<BS\>\"", "[", 
      RowBox[{"th", ",", " ", "ph"}], "]"}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:= ",
 CellID->1535504786,ExpressionUUID->"234f1fb7-07c6-bba9-5174-96f1b27009f3"],

