Cell["\<\
Four modes: one sum for the internal photon number of the two beam splitters \
on modes 1 and 2, and one path condition, since photons in modes 3 and 4 \
reach the output of mode 4 only through the splitter on modes 2 and 3.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1361313038,ExpressionUUID->"3937e1d4-04c3-e55a-68cc-f89ead77cfa0"],

